      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9w9",
          "text": "After an auto accident, there are steps to take to ensure your legal rights and physical well-being. These are as follows:",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9wd",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9wb",
          "text": "Call for help.",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9wc",
          "text": " The first call after an accident should be to medical and legal personnel for assistance. The police will document the scene and gather personal information and statements from anyone present.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9wg",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9we",
          "text": "Receive medical treatment.",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9wf",
          "text": " It is imperative to receive medical treatment immediately following any car crash. Victims of accidents often feel the impact of their injuries hours or days after their collision. Head injuries are not visible to the naked eye but need diagnosing by a physician",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9wj",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9wh",
          "text": "Document the accident scene.",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9wi",
          "text": " Only if safety allows, photos and witnesses information needs collecting at the site. Documenting the scene, vehicle damage, and having witness contact numbers will help with any future accident claim.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9wm",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9wk",
          "text": "Contact a car accident attorney.",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9wl",
          "text": " Call an experienced car accident attorney before making any statements or signing any documents from the insurance company. Insurance companies work to minimize payouts to accident victims and deny claims or settle them for the least amount possible.",
